# Deploy Rules

## Frontend (Vercel)

- Config: `vercel.json` at repo root
- Build: `npm run build -- --configuration production`
- Output: `dist/portfolio/browser` (frontend) or `dist/portfolio-admin/browser` (admin)
- API URL baked in `environment.prod.ts` — no Vercel env vars needed

## Backend (Oracle Cloud)

- Script: `portfolio-backend/deploy.bat`
- SSH alias: `ubuntu-server` → `144.24.119.210`
- Remote: `/opt/portfolio-backend/current.jar`, systemd `portfolio-backend`
- nginx proxies `portfolio-api.ragingscout97.in` → `127.0.0.1:8082`

## Checklist before deploy

1. `ng build --configuration production` passes
2. No secrets in git diff
3. Backend deploy only if `pom.xml` or `src/` Java changed

See `portfolio-deploy-kit/SERVER-ARCHITECTURE.md` for full topology.
